    "service_title": "Apex window curtains: the challenge",
    "benefit_shape": "Custom-made curtains",
    "benefit_shape_copy": "The best solution for angled windows is often custom-made curtains. Tailoring each drop to your window helps create a considered fit. The specialist team can advise on a suitable heading, fabric and lining for your shape.",
    "benefit_track": "Individual panels",
    "benefit_track_copy": "Another option is to treat each section of the angled window separately. Individual curtain panels can hang independently, which can be useful where the angles are significantly different or irregular.",
    "benefit_fit": "Curtain tracks",
    "benefit_fit_copy": "Tracks can be shaped to follow the angles of the window. A sloping installation needs a suitable track, secure supports and an agreed way to hold or gather the fabric. Opening and clear glass depend on the individual design.",
